  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: $x^2+y^2-6 x-8 y+\\lambda(x+y-1)=0$\nCentre $=\\left(3-\\frac{\\lambda}{2} \\cdot 4-\\frac{\\lambda}{2}\\right)$ Lie on $x+y-1=0$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& 3-\\frac{\\lambda}{2}+4-\\frac{\\lambda}{2}-1=0, \\lambda=6 \\\\\n& x^2+y^2-6 x-8 y+6 x+6 y-6=0 ; \\quad x^2+y^2-2 y-6=0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
